;
; Pico2_rp2350_RV32IMAC – coreDump SOC model, RISC-V variant.
; Adapted from model_coredump_soc.c_inc (ARM/Cortex-M33).
; Key differences:
;  - core_getIPSR()  → core_getCSR(RV_CSR_MCAUSE) & 0x7FFFFFFFU
;  - ARM register names (SPP/PSP/PC) → RISC-V names (sp/epcm)
;  - Function signature: void(void) instead of void(uintptr_t, uintptr_t*)
;
; Note: the general-purpose register snapshot captured by CORE_DUMP_SAVE_STACK_FRAME
; reflects register state at the dispatch level (first_handle_trap + dispatch chain),
; not the original exception-time values.  The CSR values (mcause, mepc, …) reported
; by local_printCore() are fully accurate.
